{"articleNo":"511629","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=511629&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 노동조합 교섭 요구사실의 공고","writer":"교무과","writeDate":"2025.04.14","hit":"15847","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 16pt;\">노동조합 교섭 요구 사실의 공고</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">전국국공립대학교수노동조합으로부터 교섭 요구가 있어</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;그 내용을 아래와 같이 공고합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 28.9333px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">교섭을 요구한 노동조합의 명칭</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">전국국공립대학교수노동조합</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">대표자 성명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;전국국공립대학교수노동조합 남중웅</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 28.9333px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">교섭을 요구한 일자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2025. 4. 8.(화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 28.9333px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">아울러 우리 대학과 교섭하려는 노동조합은 교섭요구 기간 내에 아래와 같이 교섭을 요구하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 28.9333px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:170%;margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:-21.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">다른 노동조합이 교섭을 요구할 수 있는 기간   </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:170%;margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:-21.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">: 2025. 4. 14.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">~ 2025. 4. 20.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:170%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:14.0pt;\">교섭 요구시 서면에 기재해야 하는 상황</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:170%;margin-left:25.5pt;text-indent:-25.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:14.0pt;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:14.0pt;\">노동조합의 명칭 및 대표자의 성명</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:170%;margin-left:25.5pt;text-indent:-25.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:14.0pt;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:14.0p